    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.743" end="00:12.281" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, no she won't</p>
      <p begin="00:12.281" end="00:15.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No, she won't understand what I be saying (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:15.040" end="00:17.851" ttm:agent="v1">She wanna **** with me, but I wanna **** with Megan</p>
      <p begin="00:17.851" end="00:20.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I hit her on the phone and she not ****ing taken (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.659" end="00:23.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ain't about the money, then no conversations (Uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:23.674" end="00:26.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No conversations, b***h, no complications (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:26.682" end="00:29.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">**** you, b***h, you took my heart, now it's breakin' (Haha)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.535" end="00:32.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You want me back now cause you feeling shameless (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.894" end="00:35.045" ttm:agent="v1">I used to know that b***h, but now she is nameless</p>
      <p begin="00:35.045" end="00:36.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ayy, I don't wanna know that b***h (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:36.342" end="00:37.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't need to know that b***h (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.705" end="00:39.308" ttm:agent="v1">20 times two, b***h</p>
      <p begin="00:39.308" end="00:40.808" ttm:agent="v1">Eat his ****ing .40 clip</p>
      <p begin="00:40.602" end="00:43.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like a Beyblade, you know a nigga's gonna have the rip (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.359" end="00:46.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Uzi MAC-11s put a p***y nigga down (Yuh, yuh, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.414" end="00:49.084" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just came up in this shit, caught a whole town (Yuh)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.084" end="00:51.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Only king in this shit, I wear the crown (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.969" end="00:54.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm the sun in the sky, b***h, I gotta shine (Gotta shine)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.761" end="00:57.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I already made my mind got no time (Yuh)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.803" end="01:00.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">None of this lost in the ****ing front house (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.681" end="01:03.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Megan, Megan, open up the door now (Please)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.433" end="01:06.384" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I pray that b***h open just don't kick me out (Haha)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.384" end="01:10.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let me explain just what this is about (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:10.652" end="01:13.477" ttm:agent="v1">Yo, I don't wanna be with you no more</p>
      <p begin="01:13.477" end="01:18.506" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't even think you understand me, huh?</p>
      <p begin="01:18.506" end="01:20.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You really don't (****)</p>
      <p begin="01:20.588" end="01:22.337" ttm:agent="v1">No she won't</p>
      <p begin="01:22.337" end="01:24.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No, she won't understand what I be saying (Uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:24.720" end="01:27.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She wanna **** with me, but I wanna **** with Megan (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:27.703" end="01:30.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I hit her on the phone and she not ****ing taken (****)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.459" end="01:33.324" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't about the money, then no conversations</p>
      <p begin="01:33.324" end="01:36.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No conversations, b***h, no complications (Ayy)</p>
